    "sections": {
        "description": "Flex Restaurant is a free, responsive theme designed for restaurants, cafes, bakeries, fast food outlets, cloud kitchens, food delivery services, and culinary businesses, offering a visually appealing and functional platform to showcase menus, manage online orders, and sell meal kits or digital recipe guides through WooCommerce for seamless online food ordering, takeaway, and ecommerce integration; with One Click Demo Import, you can instantly launch a fully designed restaurant site featuring pre-built layouts with banners highlighting chef’s specials, seasonal offers, promotions, or combo meal deals, while customizable sections allow easy editing of colors, fonts, and layouts without coding; fully mobile-optimized for smooth user experience across devices, this food ecommerce theme integrates Contact Form 7 for table reservations, inquiries, catering requests, and customer feedback, Yoast SEO for search visibility on queries like online food delivery, bakery shop online, fast food menu, or local restaurants, and optional integration with Charitable plugin for donation campaigns; ideal for modern food delivery platforms, café portals, bakery stores, or fast-casual dining websites, Flex Restaurant provides engaging menu showcases, online ordering tools, customer interaction features, and ecommerce-ready functionality, delivering a stylish, user-friendly, and high-performing solution for restaurant websites."
    },
